# Windsurf Rules for Isyara WebApp

Follow the project guidelines specified in `AGENTS.md` and check `PROJECT_STATUS.md`.

## Key Commands (Windows PowerShell)
- Always run scripts using `npm.cmd` rather than `npm`.
- Run tests: `npm.cmd test`
- Run dev: `npm.cmd run dev`
- Build: `npm.cmd run build`

## Key Constraints
- Next.js 16 + React 19: All webcam and MediaPipe components must have `'use client';`
- Always verify all 44 Vitest tests pass before considering a task complete.
